{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564530/extras/description_banner_patrick.png?t=1742660653\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the enchanting world of &quot;Hidden Cats - St. Patrick&quot; a hidden object game where your mission is to uncover every cat hidden within stunning hand-painted artwork. Let your keen eye and curiosity guide you through this captivating journey. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u203b Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude3a 100 Hidden Cats: Discover 100 hidden cats scattered throughout the artwork. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udca1 Unlimited Hints: Stuck? Use unlimited hints to find the hidden cats and keep progressing. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb5 Custom Music: Enjoy unique background music for the artwork, enhancing your immersion. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd52 Timer: Keep track of how long you take to complete the level with an in-game timer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfc5 Leaderboard: Track your best times and challenge yourself to beat them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u203b Controls:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate the scenes using your mouse to drag and move, and zoom in/out with your mouse wheel. Click on any cat you find to collect it.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u203b Accessibility Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Night Mode for comfortable viewing</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join us in &quot;Hidden Cats - St. Patrick&quot; and indulge in the perfect blend of challenge, charm, and discovery. Will you find all the hidden cats? Let the hunt begin!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Mewsie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3564530/c53c615132778308025caa3b5062cd894f155330.jpg"},{"name":"Whiskersby","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3564530/e30b072fdb6a4aad6b17e970bcc2860b05048068.jpg"},{"name":"Furrbert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3564530/ddae456780b3a3c3aa3d2fd94f111ed41fc37bec.jpg"},{"name":"Purrlina","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3564530/535629929e7918c92a591712f24b044bcc16baef.jpg"},{"name":"Clawbert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3564530/581802722694462231f5b87c8bd99d2a4365b6a1.jpg"},{"name":"Purrabelle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3564530/118ace2f6ee602acb398980f142aa2fd443ed50e.jpg"},{"name":"Scratchilda","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3564530/9efd04a450f4e9bbbe5616209f902aeccb6a0c9f.jpg"},{"name":"Scratchy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3564530/458f946abd12c9e4a072cfca25bcf4283cf0b754.jpg"},{"name":"Furrball","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3564530/3ade2059aad8e9c3db05bd502c19476cde4b97a3.jpg"},{"name":"Purrsephone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3564530/48f7d7ba091b84522cbed6cf99f385595aa95414.jpg"}],"total":100},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3564530?t=1742660653","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564530/31c5fa6bb190ea1dc60cf244ca8c2e9ec3af2bfb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742660653","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564530/c36de9c0df86cfb78fa79333ef53981a33059bb4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742660653","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564530/c36de9c0df86cfb78fa79333ef53981a33059bb4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742660653","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564530/extras/description_banner_patrick.png?t=1742660653\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the enchanting world of &quot;Hidden Cats - St. Patrick&quot; a hidden object game where your mission is to uncover every cat hidden within stunning hand-painted artwork. Let your keen eye and curiosity guide you through this captivating journey. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u203b Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude3a 100 Hidden Cats: Discover 100 hidden cats scattered throughout the artwork. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udca1 Unlimited Hints: Stuck? Use unlimited hints to find the hidden cats and keep progressing. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb5 Custom Music: Enjoy unique background music for the artwork, enhancing your immersion. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd52 Timer: Keep track of how long you take to complete the level with an in-game timer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfc5 Leaderboard: Track your best times and challenge yourself to beat them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u203b Controls:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate the scenes using your mouse to drag and move, and zoom in/out with your mouse wheel. Click on any cat you find to collect it.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u203b Accessibility Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Night Mode for comfortable viewing</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join us in &quot;Hidden Cats - St. Patrick&quot; and indulge in the perfect blend of challenge, charm, and discove